{"name":"Product chain","purpose":"Every product, software or hardware, is documented as one chain: a Release is delivered as a ProductRevision, which is a revision of a Product, which Offerings package for CustomerSegments. Start at a Release and walk that chain, picking up each revision's evidence (design concepts, evidence bundles, demonstrations).

Only recorded relationships count. A revision at the concept stage with a design concept is an idea with pictures, not a shipped product. The view grants no authorization and starts no execution.","rootTypes":["Release"],"selection":{"relationships":[{"type":"delivered_as","from_type":"Release","to_type":"ProductRevision"},{"type":"revision_of","from_type":"ProductRevision","to_type":"Product"},{"type":"packages_product","direction":"incoming","from_type":"Offering","to_type":"Product"},{"type":"for_customer","from_type":"Offering","to_type":"CustomerSegment"},{"type":"evidence_for","direction":"incoming","to_type":"ProductRevision"}],"maxDepth":4,"maxNodes":200},"query":"query ProductChain($roots: [String!]!) {
